nia_1i_4":"The bards of Tir na Nog sing of a champion. Become that song.","cine.hibernia_1o_1":"Solasdrach’s light fades over the hills.","cine.hibernia_1o_2":"But to the east, Cúchulainn’s Marches burn.","cine.hibernia_1o_3":"A foreign garrison now holds Tara.","cine.hibernia_2i_1":"Tara guards Claiomh Solais, the Sword of Light of Eriu.","cine.hibernia_2i_2":"The invaders have corrupted its guardian.","cine.hibernia_2i_3":"Free the keep, before the Sword leaves Eriu.","cine.hibernia_2o_1":"The Sword of Light is safe.","cine.hibernia_2o_2":"But the druids whisper of an ancient eye...","cine.hibernia_2o_3":"...that has opened again, at Tor Conaind.","cine.hibernia_3i_1":"Tor Conaind, where the Fomorians were buried long ago.","cine.hibernia_3i_2":"The giants of the sea have returned.","cine.hibernia_3i_3":"Balor of the Evil Eye wakes. His gaze alone can wither a forest.","cine.hibernia_3i_4":"Lugh once struck him down. Now it is your turn.","cine.hibernia_3o_1":"The Eye of Balor closes.","cine.hibernia_3o_2":"Across Eriu, the harps play again.","cine.hibernia_4i_1":"From Tir na Nog, the heroes of Eriu set out for the Spire.","cine.hibernia_4o_1":"In Tir na Nog, the harps play your song... until the next war.","cine.shared_spire":"Far away, a spire of stone pierces the clouds.","cine.finale_i_1":"The World Spire. At its summit lie the shards of Arthur’s Crown.","cine.finale_i_2":"The three realms bled for nothing. The Sundered King waits at the top.","cine.finale_i_3":"For once, Logres, Nordmark and Eriu march together.","cine.finale_o_1":"Beneath the Sundered King’s crown, it was Morgana all along.","cine.finale_o_2":"The Fay falls, and her laughter fades into the wind.","cine.finale_o_3":"The shards of the Crown fall silent..."},n={"cine.next":"Klicke für die nächste Szene","cine.next.touch":"Tippe für die nächste Szene","cine.actIntro":"Akt {n} — {zone}","cine.actOutro":"{zone}: Sieg","cine.prologue":"Prolog — Die Zerbrochene Krone","cine.partIntro":"Auftakt","cin